                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "acca448a-4da6-480a-abdf-fe11b21ba90d",
                        "source_entry_id": "f9dfa3ad-f1b9-3cac-9147-093f0ccca0ca",
                        "source_sense_id": "9404c1ce-94e1-3129-9828-e71bf8765394",
                        "target_lang_word": "courageously",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "courageously",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "86b7a85b-304e-3a1b-802a-055de3b13a58",
                                        "entry_id": "2198d31f-70b1-3994-8c72-ca37087f5fd4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a courageous manner; bravely; boldly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1a868d7-e886-4fcc-a724-df8bbf44c90d",
                                                "sense_id": "86b7a85b-304e-3a1b-802a-055de3b13a58",
                                                "text": "Strike vp the Drum and martch corragiouſly,\nFortune her ſelfe dooth ſit vpon our Creſts."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "45e95a2d-fc25-4bb9-bab3-0c0d33f75491",
                        "source_entry_id": "f9dfa3ad-f1b9-3cac-9147-093f0ccca0ca",
                        "source_sense_id": "9404c1ce-94e1-3129-9828-e71bf8765394",
                        "target_lang_word": "bravely",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bravely",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4bc217df-cff6-3b83-a0cf-19a6a1cbec6c",
                                        "entry_id": "af06285a-389f-31a9-a47e-ded0c213034c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a brave manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7fc15363-cf0b-490e-9b66-4929950541cb",
                                                "sense_id": "4bc217df-cff6-3b83-a0cf-19a6a1cbec6c",
                                                "text": "The soldiers faced the enemy bravely."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe6194dc-737b-4d12-a115-6f3f4028bb1c",
                                                "sense_id": "4bc217df-cff6-3b83-a0cf-19a6a1cbec6c",
                                                "text": "Here, here, here's an excellent place; here we may see most bravely: I'll tell you them all by their names as they pass by; but mark Troilus above the rest."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba74d131-0fac-4ca7-845c-9e79c2c2bcc1",
                                                "sense_id": "4bc217df-cff6-3b83-a0cf-19a6a1cbec6c",
                                                "text": "No, they hold there a large, round wad of tow and cork, enveloped in the thickest and toughest of ox-hide. That bravely and uninjured takes the jam which would have snapped all their oaken handspikes and iron crow-bars."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5033be6-a1ea-429a-93d6-1797fcd465a4",
                                                "sense_id": "4bc217df-cff6-3b83-a0cf-19a6a1cbec6c",
                                                "text": "[H]e stepped forward and said bravely, though his hand trembled, and his face was as pale as snow:—\n“My true friend, from the bottom of my broken heart I thank you. Tell me what I am to do, and I shall not falter!”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a86ce3fc-6fc5-476c-a320-34d8bf236bed",
                        "source_entry_id": "f9dfa3ad-f1b9-3cac-9147-093f0ccca0ca",
                        "source_sense_id": "9404c1ce-94e1-3129-9828-e71bf8765394",
                        "target_lang_word": "courageusement",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "courageusement",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d22c5f59-4575-3594-8173-aeba7ab70ca0",
                                        "entry_id": "beb5a0fc-e718-39d9-ad62-12042397d177",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Avec courage, fermeté."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5a5df63-f4d1-4a1a-bf98-0388ba4cf5e9",
                                                "sense_id": "d22c5f59-4575-3594-8173-aeba7ab70ca0",
                                                "text": "Ils ravagent tout ce qui est entre la Somme et l’Oise, et, tant que personne ne leur résiste, ils tiennent courageusement la campagne, ils tuent nos paysans et brûlent nos villages."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6243c03f-333c-4296-b5fc-e5f196a019b8",
                                                "sense_id": "d22c5f59-4575-3594-8173-aeba7ab70ca0",
                                                "text": "Si Gustave en doutait, vous ne le verriez pas Si courageusement s'avancer au trépas."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d32ee025-0714-478a-8d29-e8aa61931773",
                                                "sense_id": "d22c5f59-4575-3594-8173-aeba7ab70ca0",
                                                "text": "Et, sous cette pluie de projectiles, on voit les bataillons des brigades Blondlat et Moussy, accrochés aux pentes dénudées du terrain, progresser lentement, courageusement, sûrement, vers Bertoncourt. Le sentiment général est que ce magnifique effort aboutira."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "53ce1945-e16e-43c9-952f-6290494b071c",
                                                "sense_id": "d22c5f59-4575-3594-8173-aeba7ab70ca0",
                                                "text": "Vous vous attaquez courageusement aux tâches rébarbatives de la journée."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "dcf01c37-5f14-4fd5-bf69-8e771f4a74be",
                        "source_entry_id": "f9dfa3ad-f1b9-3cac-9147-093f0ccca0ca",
